              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko aka Omwami NYASAYE yamanyia; mbu lola, yali nakasinjia tsisiche, mundaalo olwa omuboka kweshirumbi kwali nikumela; khwali okhumela khweshirumbi, okhulonda khukhukhaaya khwomuruchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
