        {
          "text": "Kano niko aka Omwami NYASAYE yamanyia mbu lola, Omwami NYASAYE yali nalanganga obukhalachi bwomulilo; nakwo kwamala olusiba olukhongo, nikwenya okhulia nende eshialo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
