        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Amazia omukuhani waBeteli yakhupila Yeroboamu omuruchi waIsiraeli omunwa, ari Amosi asanjilaane nabashie okhukhufukula hakari weinzu yaIsiraeli; eshibala shishinyala okhwisimilisilia amakhuwake kosi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
